{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/group(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Keeps the given component types packed in the same order, so that queries and updates of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exactly these types visit their entities without lookups.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"]]},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"WorldModule","title":"group(_:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V5groupyyxmxQpRvzAA9ComponentRzlF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"group","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":").Type)","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Group.swift#L70","fileName":"Group.swift"}},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Speeding Up Queries","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(checked:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/cache(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/index(_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lookup(_:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Speeding-Up-Queries"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"group"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"types"},{"kind":"text","text":": repeat (each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":").Type) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" repeat each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component types to keep packed together."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"types"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A query of several types normally walks one type’s storage and looks up the entity in each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the others. After you group the types, the entities that hold all of them sit at the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"front of each type’s storage, at the same positions, and spawning, inserting, removing and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"despawning keep them there. A query of the same types in any order, or an update that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"writes and reads exactly those types, walks that front directly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a group for a set of types you visit together on every step, such as position and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"velocity:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["var world = World()","let comet = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 2))","world.spawn(Position(x: 9, y: 9))","world.group(Position.self, Velocity.self)","","world.update(Position.self, reading: Velocity.self) { position, row in","    position.x += row.components.dx","    position.y += row.components.dy","}","print(world[Position.self, of: comet])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 1.0, y: 2.0)\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Grouping doesn’t change which entities a query or update visits, only how it finds them."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It does change the order queries list entities in, and makes adding and removing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"grouped types a little slower. Each type belongs to at most one group. A copy of the world"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps the group; a snapshot doesn’t."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":"·"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}]},{"type":"text","text":") for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" entities in the smallest of the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"t"}]},{"type":"text","text":" types."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"},{"type":"aside","name":"Precondition","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"types"},{"type":"text","text":" lists at least two distinct types, and no other group owns any of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them. The checked spelling, "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(checked:)"},{"type":"text","text":", throws instead."}]}],"style":"note"}]}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/cache(_:)":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a list of the entities that match a query’s structure, so that queries and updates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with the same conditions visit only those entities."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/cache(_:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/cache(_:)","type":"topic","title":"cache(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cache","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV","text":"Query"},{"kind":"text","text":"<repeat each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/lookup(_:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Returns the entities holding a component equal to the given value.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/lookup(_:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/lookup(_:)","type":"topic","title":"lookup(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lookup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World":{"abstract":[{"text":"A collection of entities, the components they hold, and resources.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"World"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","type":"topic","title":"World","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"World"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/group(checked:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Keeps the given component types packed in the same order, throwing an error if they can’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be grouped.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/group(checked:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/group(checked:)","type":"topic","title":"group(checked:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"group"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"checked"},{"kind":"text","text":": repeat (each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":").Type) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule10GroupErrorO","text":"GroupError"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Component":{"title":"Component","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A type that can be stored as a component of an entity."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/component","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Component","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Component","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/index(_:)":{"title":"index(_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"index","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":".Type)"}],"kind":"symbol"